-- Smash history: top 8s for the biggest majors before start.gg (Matthew, 2026-11-18: "Continue with top 8s
-- and entrant counts", then "Continue"). The next tier after 20270112100000. Read by hand in Matthew's Chrome from each tournament's own Liquipedia page (its
-- placement table), one page at a time, several seconds apart: 24 more games: the biggest
-- remaining Smash 4 majors of 2015-2016, Melee and Project M majors of 2014-2016 and Apex 2010, and Brawl at
-- Apex 2010-2015 and GENESIS (2009). This reading stopped when the session's safety check blocked more. Facts only; credited to
-- Liquipedia (CC-BY-SA) like the rest of these majors. Only replaces the winner/runner-up saved by
-- 20270111100000 for these hand-added majors; safe to run twice.

